{{/*
  DESIGN-OWNED ARTIFACT — scope.tmpl · package v3.9.0 · WORKFLOW.md v4
  Source of truth: examples/console/Scope.jsx · shot 02. Replaces the "scope" define in
  templates_scope.go (and the repo-authored "proposals" define, folded in here).
  Holes: .Notice .IsAdmin .AddressCap .Seeds[{ID,Anchor,Scope,IsAddress}] .FormScope .FormError
  .Refusals[{Input,Reason,Reachable}] (one per refused token — DF-F1; replaces the single .Refusal)
  .CustodyScopes[{ID,Scope,CustodyExtension,Census}]
  .CustodyCensus[{Name,Address,Declined,Scope}] .CustodyCensusFailed (#987)
  .CustodyError .ZoneScopes[{ID,Domain,HasFile,SuppliedAt,IntervalLabel,AgingLabel}]
  .ZoneErrors[{File,Reason}] (one per refused file — DF-F2; replaces .ZoneError)
  .ZoneIntervalDays .ZoneIntervalError .NameTree[{Label,Count,Sev,Children[{Label,Sev}]}]
  .CoverageMsgs[{Kind,Badge,Bound,Subject,Text,When,ISO}] .Proposals[{ID,Value,Kind,Source}]
  .OrgQuery .Exclusions[{ID,Kind,Value}] .ExclError .ExclKind .ExclValue .ExclPreview{Fires,Headline,Loss}
  Reconciliations (SPEC-CHANGE #21, ruled): spec two-column card layout; seed kind select drops —
  the handler infers name/address from the value's shape (#21a); refusals render the spec
  RefusalCallout from .Refusal; custody renders the spec toggle+census once per name scope (#21b);
  zone upload is the spec FileDrop — seed select drops, the handler infers the scope from the
  file's apex (#21c); cold-tier + prober config relocate to /settings (their design homes, shots
  17–18) (#21d); the exclusion Preview receipt stays (spec-styled). Forms keep their POST routes.
  Dogfood features (WORK-ORDER-FEATURES-1): DF-F1 — the declare input paste-splits server-side
  (tokens split on commas/whitespace/newlines, one declaration each, per-token refusal callouts);
  DF-F2 — zone re-supply accepts multiple files, one dated act per file, per-file refusals.
*/}}
{{define "scope"}}{{template "head" .}}
{{template "chrome" .}}
<style>
@keyframes sc-pop { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px) scale(0.985); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); } }
.sc-main { max-width: 1440px; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
